## Advanced: old file names

Scripts that download older file names no longer work. The files were renamed and the old names were removed in v1.94:

| Old name | Current name |
|---|---|
| `koboldcpp_cu12.exe` | `koboldcpp.exe` |
| `koboldcpp_nocuda.exe` | `koboldcpp-nocuda.exe` |
| `koboldcpp_oldcpu.exe` | `koboldcpp-oldpc.exe` |
| `koboldcpp-linux-x64-cuda1210` | `koboldcpp-linux-x64` |
| `koboldcpp-linux-x64-cuda1150` | `koboldcpp-linux-x64-oldpc` |

To always get the newest file, download from this address, with the file name at the end:

```text
https://github.com/LostRuins/koboldcpp/releases/latest/download/<file name>
```

